  "body": "Massive home on 1100m2 freehold overlooking Little Manly Beach and boat ramp with stunning 180 degree views around the Gulf, including Tiritiri Matangi, Rangitoto, City & Sky Tower, from the supersized living areas and the Master suite.  \r\n\r\nDownsizing is on the vendors agenda - offered For Sale By Negotiation, deadline sale date 16th December 2026 at 4.00pm (unless sold prior). Don't miss the opportunity to view this amazing residence.  LIM and Council Property File is  available for your perusal.\r\n\r\nWhat is on offer? \r\nSingle level sundrenched living with stunning Master suite, private Guest suite, and Family wing; superb outdoor flow to sundrenched decks and lawns. Huge double garage and workshop, space for the kayaks and water toys and loads of storage plus a garden shed.\r\n\r\nJust 10 years old, 314m2 more or less, designed for the future, weatherboard, aerated concrete panels and block with coloursteel roof. Gorgeous high stud living spaces, supersized stackers opening most rooms to the outside, double glazed,  flooring is American Oak, tile and carpet. Granite benchtops, huge bathrooms, separate laundry, Masport woodburner, underfloor heating, solar panels, bonus rainwater tank servicing the laundry, toilets and outdoor taps. Town supply water and wastewater, sewage. The list does not end there!",
